The real table layouts go here, one file per map:

    name: table_01
    terrain:
      - { footprint: [12, 8, 18, 14] }
    objectives:
      - area: [[12, 8], [19, 8], [19, 15], [12, 15]]

`objectives` is optional. Every entry must be determined — an `area` outline
(the ground itself is the objective) or x/y for a marker with a radius.

Read by `just measure-maps`, previews by `just render-maps`. See ../../README.md.
